<title>GREECE: Greek one-mth Athibor jumps to 11.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Greek one-mth Athibor jumps to 11.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek one-month Athibor, the reference rate for the local interbank market, rose to 11.5 percent from Wednesday's 10.93 percent on continued forex outflows, dealers said.</p>
</text>
